  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "The three verb keys share spelling in the index. Cultivation, absence and military support each have their own evidence. The connection between the military expression and the verb for helping remains uncertain. The Syriac verb עדר and helper noun מעדרנא already belong to the עזר entry. The separately attested lentil noun is filed under עדש (adashah)."
